<%= render layout: "topic", locals: {
  headline: "Take your station to more viewers.",
  intro: "Keep running your station while exploring another outlet for its programming. Bring a channel, a regional show, or an event you want to share.",
  action: "Discuss station carriage", subject: "Lightek station partnership",
  prompts: ["Station and market:", "Public site or authorized stream:", "Programming focus:", "Carriage, licensing, or sponsorship interest:"]
} do %>
  <section>
    <h2>Make your lineup travel</h2>
    <p>Explore carriage in the Lightek web and Roku lineup and time-limited licensing with participating stations. The agreement defines where a channel appears, what can be promoted or replayed, and who controls ad inventory.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Decide how the deal works</h2>
    <p>Discuss reporting, eligible sponsored-airing revenue, and when payments would be due. Bring a public link and information about the programming rights you can offer.</p>
  </section>
<% end %>
